iew": 1016, "last_played": 1728336132, "avatar": "abaf1999813695632521ca458cf6aea7539a9fef"}, "language": "english", "review": "If you liked the first one, this is more of the same.", "timestamp_created": 1728336277, "timestamp_updated": 1728336277, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "176586710", "author": {"steamid": "76561198010730555", "personaname": "Fox", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198010730555/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 3461, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3423, "last_played": 1730165284, "avatar": "f8a7ecc33a05eff5ebdf45a875e698c4c717fcd9"}, "language": "english", "review": "Not quite Elden-gun, but super fun. Do not judge this game by the first one. Also they have DOG... you get to have dog right at the start.", "timestamp_created": 1728333153, "timestamp_updated": 1730115049, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "176586476", "author": {"steamid": "76561198052534123", "personaname": "Rivomist", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198052534123/", "num_games_owned": 73, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 2443, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2443, "last_played": 1728327758, "avatar": "754a96e28f732aadc3c09ad6457a84249d61ddcb"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game is one of the most controversial gaming phenomena I have ever encountered. And I give it a negative rating only because at first it really sucked me in, which led to a series of painful acquaintances with its depths.\r\n\r\nFirst, about the good. The game may appeal to those who are interested in tinkering with character leveling, creating variable builds and, in general, souls lovers, I consider myself to be in all these categories. Despite all its grayness and monotony of locations (of which there are only 4-5 variations in the game), it is pleasing to the eye. It is also played quite cheerfully and the game easily finds a balance of difficulty, realizing that it is not Darksouls and there is no need for excessive hardcore in it.\r\n\r\nAnd if your goal is to complete the game, trying to optimize your build from what came across during its passage - it is really good. But now about its bad side. As soon as you decide to optimize your character in small details, find all the rings, amulets, relics necessary for the build - you get into a real hell. And grinding in this game is a separate circle of it.\r\n\r\nAll items from the random pool can be happily obtained in the boss rush mode, but for specific items from random events you will have to run hundreds of times through the same locations in the hope of the right pattern, running past the same mobs that become completely uninteresting, waiting for the same long elevators, listening to the same stories of characters.\r\n\r\nThe developers clearly had a rather perverted idea of ​​​​how to captivate players to get the rarest items: you will have to go through the same company many dozens of times (yes, yes, exactly the same, because you will need one specific pattern) and then, having already completed more than half of it, restart, because further randomness knocked you down. And instead of having fun in the boss rush, you run around the same circle (of hell) like a squirrel in a wheel.", "timestamp_created": 1728332855, "timestamp_updated": 1728332855, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.474452555179595947", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": []}]}